"Gone Baby Gone" and "Argo."

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:10.643
He stars in "Bosch,"
which premieres its final season

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:13.313 line:92%
June 25th on Amazon Prime Video.

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:15.281 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.950 line:92%
-How long have you known?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What?
-About Pena and the feds.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
